n los baristas italianos, con m\u00e1quina de caf\u00e9 espresso o autom\u00e1tica.<br><\/p><p><p>Espresso Barista Intenso presenta una gran intensidad y cuerpo, con notas de cacao y madera y un regusto prolongado e intenso.<\/p><p><ul><li><b>COMPOSICI\u00d3N<\/b><\/li><li>Ar\u00e1bica y Robusta<\/li><li><b>ORIGEN<\/b><\/li><li>Sudeste asi\u00e1tico, \u00c1frica y Centro y Sudam\u00e9rica<\/li><li><b>LUGAR DE PRODUCCI\u00d3N<\/b><\/li><li>Settimo Torinese, Italia<\/li><\/ul><div>Gran intensidad y cuerpo, con notas de cacao y madera y un regusto intenso<br><\/div><div><br><\/div><div><p><ul><li><b>Notas arom\u00e1ticas<\/b><\/li><li>Cacao<\/li><li>Madera<\/li><li><b>Intensidad<\/b><\/li><li>9<\/li><li><b>Tueste<\/b><\/li><li>Tambor<\/li><li><b style='background-color: initial;'>Descripci\u00f3n<\/b><\/li><li>Granos de caf\u00e9<\/li><li><b style='background-color: initial;'>Tama\u00f1o del paquete<\/b><\/li><li>500 g, paquete blando<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/div><div><br><\/div><\/p><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"LAVAZZA","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.53,"unit_price":12.12,"unit_price_tax":12.12,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cocina","sub_category":"Capsulas de cafe","quantity":5,"brand":"LAVAZZA","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_lav-cafe%20espreso%20b%20int%20500g_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":7.12}}},"8000070018754":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8000070018754",false],"wholesale_price":[7.45,false],"price":[12.45,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.52",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without