jas. Un aparato b\u00e1sico para repasar tu barba en cualquier lugar y ocasi\u00f3n.<\/p><p><ul><li><b>Especificaciones<\/b><\/li><li>Precisi\u00f3n desde 0.6mm (sin peine gu\u00eda) hasta 12mm.<\/li><li>Acc. regulable 5 posiciones (min. 2mm y m\u00e1x.12mm).<\/li><li>5 peines gu\u00eda 2\/5\/7\/10\/12mm.<\/li><li>3 accesorios para corte: &nbsp;<\/li><ul><li>&nbsp;1.5 mm cuchilla peque\u00f1a.<\/li><li>&nbsp;3 mm cuchilla mediana. &nbsp;<\/li><li>&nbsp;4.5 mm cuchilla grande.<\/li><\/ul><li>Ancho de corte: 30mm.<\/li><li>Cuchillas de carbono autoafilables.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Incluye recortadora de nariz y orejas.<\/li><li>Peine y aceite lubricante. &nbsp;<\/li><li>Cepillo de limpieza. &nbsp;<\/li><li>Base para guardar.<\/li><li>Funciona con pilas 3xAA (no incluidas).<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"WAHL","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.3,"unit_price":15.77,"unit_price_tax":15.77,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cuidado Personal","sub_category":"Cortapelos","quantity":2,"brand":"WAHL","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_wah-pae-cor%20mustac%20beard%2012a_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":10.77}}},"0043917000183":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["0043917000183",false],"wholesale_price":[6.49,false],"price":[11.49,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.14",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:87568","Cat. IDs: 2","Associated Catego