l dispositivo de red IJ est\u00e1n disponibles en los siguientes sistemas operativos:<\/li>  <li>Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1, Windows Server 2012 R2, Windows Server 2016<\/li>  <li>Sistemas m\u00f3viles compatibles<\/li>  <li>iOS, Android (mediante aplicaci\u00f3n Canon PRINT Inkjet\/SELPHY)<\/li>  <li>Requisitos m\u00ednimos del sistema<\/li>  <li>Windows: 2,0 GB o m\u00e1s<\/li>  <li>Nota: Para la instalaci\u00f3n del software incluido. La cantidad necesaria de espacio en el disco duro.<\/li>  <li>Pantalla: 1024 x 768 XGA<\/li>  <li>Software incluido<\/li>  <li>Driver de la impresora<\/li>  <li>IJ Printer Assistant Tool<\/li>  <li><b>Caracter\u00edsticas f\u00edsicas<\/b><\/li>  <li>Peso<\/li>  <li>aprox. 6,0 kg<\/li>  <li>Dimensiones (An. x Pr. x Al.)<\/li>  <li>aprox. 403 x 369 x 166 mm<\/li>  <li>Niveles de ruido<\/li>  <li>aprox. 52 dB (A)  <\/li><li>Fuente de alimentaci\u00f3n<\/li>  <li>100-240 V CA, 50\/60 Hz<\/li>  <li>Consumo el\u00e9ctrico<\/li>  <li>Apagada: aprox. 0,3 W<\/li>  <li>En espera (conectado al PC mediante USB): aprox. 0,8 W<\/li>  <li>En espera (todos los puertos conectados): aprox. 1,6 W<\/li>  <li>Tiempo para entrar en modo en espera: 1 minuto, 29 segundos<\/li>  <li>Impresi\u00f3n (conexi\u00f3n USB a PC): aprox. 13 W<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"CANON","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":7.05,"unit_price":133.17,"unit_price_tax":133.17,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Multifunciones  e Impresoras","sub_category":"Impresoras","quantity":5,"brand":"CANON","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_can-imp%20pixma%20gm2050%20bk_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":128.17}}},"4549292186574":{"result":true,"need_alert":