ado: Teclado de tama\u00f1o completo de color plata natural y con teclado num\u00e9rico<\/li>  <li>Inal\u00e1mbrico: Combo Realtek Wi-Fi 6 (1x2) y Bluetooth\u00ae 5.2 (soporta velocidad de datos gigabit)11,12,131<\/li>  <li>Tipo de fuente de alimentaci\u00f3n: Adaptador de alimentaci\u00f3n Smart AC de 45 W<\/li>  <li>Tipo de bater\u00eda: Bater\u00eda de ion-litio de 3 celdas 41 Wh<\/li>  <li>Etiquetas ecol\u00f3gicas: Con registro EPEAT\u00ae<\/li>  <li>Certificado Energy Star: Certificaci\u00f3n ENERGY STAR\u00ae<\/li>  <li>Dise\u00f1o de productos: Base y cubierta con acabado pintado, marco del teclado con patr\u00f3n de cepillado vertical y funda de silicona<\/li>  <li>Color del producto: Plata natural<\/li>  <li>Dimensiones m\u00ednimas (ancho x fondo x alto): 35,85 x 24,2 x 1,79 cm (Las dimensiones var\u00edan seg\u00fan la configuraci\u00f3n)<\/li>  <li>Peso: 1,69 kg<\/li>  <li>Dimensiones del embalaje (ancho x fondo x alto): 6,9 x 30,5 x 52 cm<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"HP","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":2.35,"unit_price":447.73,"unit_price_tax":447.73,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Portatiles","sub_category":"Portatiles","quantity":2,"brand":"HP","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_hpp-pre%2015s-eq2125ns_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":442.73}}},"0196548785964":{"result":false,"need_alert":false,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["0196548785964",false],"wholesale_price":[320.85,false],"price":[325.85,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["",false],"weight":["",false],"images":["",false],"tags":["",false],"features":["",false],"combinations":["",false]},"need_alert":false,"errors":["A p