exi\u00f3n por Bluetooth a dispositivos de reproducci\u00f3n de audio externos (altavoces, auriculares, etc).<\/li>  <li>Lector de huella dactilar, integrado en tecla de encendido.<\/li>  <li>HDD Security y Encriptaci\u00f3n TPM.<\/li>  <li>Bot\u00f3n de acceso r\u00e1pido de desconexi\u00f3n de webcam y micr\u00f3fono.<\/li>  <li>Puerto para Slim Kensington-Lock.<\/li>  <li>Modos de pantalla: DayLight &amp; Lectura.<\/li>  <li>Auto-Encendido al abrir la tapa.<\/li>  <li>Sistema Operativo Windows 11 Pro (64bit).<\/li>  <li>Webcam con sensor IR, FHD y doble micr\u00f3fono MEMS.<\/li>  <li><b>PUERTOS<\/b><\/li>  <ul><li>2 x USB 3.2 (Tipo-A)<\/li><li>2 x USB 4 Gen3x2 (Tipo-C) con carga r\u00e1pida **, Display Port, Thunderbolt 4 integrado<\/li><li>1 x HDMI<\/li><li>1 x Toma auriculares 3.5mm <\/li><li>1 x Ranura para tarjetas&nbsp; UFS y MicroSD 3.0 tipo UHS-I (104 MByte\/s)<\/li><\/ul>          <li><b>CONECTIVIDAD<\/b><\/li>  <li>Intel Wi-Fi 6 AX211 (Bandas: 2'4GHz y 5GHz; Velocidad M\u00e1x. 2,4Gbps)<\/li>  <li>10\/100\/Gigabit con adaptador RJ45 (no incluido)<\/li>  <li>Bluetooth 5.1<\/li>  <li><b>CONSUMO<\/b><\/li>  <li>Bater\u00eda de Pol\u00edmero de Litio de 72 Wh (9360 mAh) *<\/li>  <li><b>DIMENSIONES<\/b> <\/li>  <li>313.4 x 215.2 x 16.8 mm (999g).<\/li><\/ul><br><p><\/p><p><\/p><\/div><\/div>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"LG","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":1.84,"unit_price":1239.04,"unit_price_tax":1239.04,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Portatiles","sub_category":"Portatiles","quantity":2,"brand":"LG","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_lgp-14z90q-g%20ap75b_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":1234.04}}},"8806091698759":{"result":false,"ne