00%<\/li><li>Altitud m\u00e1xima de trabajo<\/li><li>3.000 m.s.n.m. (degradaci\u00f3n de potencia hasta 4.000 m)<\/li><li>Grado de protecci\u00f3n<\/li><li>IP65<\/li><li>Aislamiento<\/li><li>Sin transformador<\/li><li>Refrigeraci\u00f3n<\/li><li>Convecci\u00f3n natural (sin ventiladores)(3)<\/li><li>Ruido ac\u00fastico a 1 metro<\/li><li>25 dB(3)<\/li><li>Tipo de terminales<\/li><li>MC4<\/li><li>Instalaci\u00f3n<\/li><li>Instalaci\u00f3n interior y exterior \/ Soporte en pared<\/li><li>Topolog\u00eda<\/li><li>Conexi\u00f3n a red (On grid)<\/li><li><b>NORMATIVA<\/b><\/li><li>Certificado<\/li><li>EN 61000-6-2\/3<\/li><li>Seguridad \/ CEM<\/li><li>IEC 62109-1\/2 \/ EN 61000-6-2\/3<\/li><li>Eficiencia energ\u00e9tica<\/li><li>IEC EN UNE 61683<\/li><li>Ensayos ambientales<\/li><li>IEC EN UNE 60068-2-1\/2\/14\/30<\/li><li>Funcionamiento \/ Protecci\u00f3n<\/li><li>UNE EN 62116:2014, IEC 61727:2004, UNE 217002:2020, UNE 217001:2020<\/li><li>Gesti\u00f3n de Calidad y Ambiental<\/li><li>ISO 9001, ISO 14001, ISO 45001<\/li><li><b>DIMENSIONES<\/b><\/li><li>Fondo (mm)<\/li><li>120<\/li><li>Ancho (mm)<\/li><li>410<\/li><li>Alto (mm)<\/li><li>360<\/li><li><b>PESO<\/b><\/li><li>Peso (kg)<\/li><li>13<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><br><p><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"SALICRU","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":15.3,"unit_price":803.37,"unit_price_tax":803.37,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"S.A.I.","sub_category":"Inversores de Corriente","quantity":0,"brand":"SALICRU","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_slc-inv%20eqx2%206002-sx_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":798.37}}},"8436584873518":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8