es<\/li>  <li>16M<\/li>  <li>Max Refresh Rate (Main Display)<\/li>  <li>90 Hz<\/li>  <li><b>C\u00e1mara<\/b><\/li>  <li>C\u00e1mara principal - Resoluci\u00f3n (M\u00faltiple)<\/li>  <li>50.0 MP + 2.0 MP + 2.0 MP<\/li>  <li>C\u00e1mara principal - Apertura (M\u00faltiple)<\/li>  <li>F1.8 , F2.4 , F2.4<\/li>  <li>C\u00e1mara principal - Autofocus<\/li>  <li>S\u00ed<\/li>  <li>C\u00e1mara principal Zoom<\/li>  <li>Zoom digital hasta 10x<\/li>  <li>C\u00e1mara frontal - Resoluci\u00f3n<\/li>  <li>5.0 MP<\/li>  <li>C\u00e1mara frontal - Apertura<\/li>  <li>F2.2<\/li>  <li>C\u00e1mara principal - Flash<\/li>  <li>S\u00ed<\/li>  <li>Resoluci\u00f3n de grabaci\u00f3n de v\u00eddeo<\/li>  <li>FHD (1920 x 1080)@30fps<\/li>  <li><b>Memoria<\/b><\/li>  <li>RAM (GB)<\/li>  <li>3<\/li>  <li>Memoria Interna (GB)<\/li>  <li>32<\/li>  <li>Memoria Disponible* (GB)<\/li>  <li>19.2<\/li>  <li>Externa<\/li>  <li>MicroSD (hasta 1TB)<\/li>  <li><b>Redes\/Bandas<\/b><\/li>  <li>N\u00famero de SIM<\/li>  <li>Dual-SIM<\/li>  <li>Tipo de SIM<\/li>  <li>Nano-SIM (4FF)<\/li>  <li>Tipo de bandeja de SIM<\/li>  <li>SIM 1 + SIM 2 + MicroSD<\/li>  <li>Infra<\/li>  <li>2G GSM, 3G WCDMA, 4G LTE FDD, 4G LTE TDD<\/li>  <li>2G GSM<\/li>  <li>GSM850, GSM900, DCS1800<\/li>  <li>3G UMTS<\/li>  <li>B1(2100), B5(850), B8(900)<\/li>  <li>4G FDD LTE<\/li>  <li>B1(2100), B3(1800), B5(850), B7(2600), B8(900), B20(800), B28(700)<\/li>  <li>4G TDD LTE<\/li>  <li>B38(2600), B40(2300), B41(2500)<\/li>  <li><b>Conectividad<\/b><\/li>  <li>Interfaz USB<\/li>  <li>USB Tipo C<\/li>  <li>Versi\u00f3n USB<\/li>  <li>USB 2.0<\/li>  <li>Localizaci\u00f3n<\/li>  <li>GPS, Glonass, Beidou, Galileo, QZSS<\/li>  <li>Auriculares<\/li>  <li>3.5mm Stereo<\/li>  <li>Wi-Fi<\/li>  <li>802.11 a\/b\/g\/n\/ac 2.4G+5GHz, VHT80<\/li>  <li>Wi-Fi Direct<\/li>  <li>S\u00ed<\/li>  <li>Versi\u00f3n Bluetooth<\/li>  <li>Bluetooth v5.0<\/li>  <li>NFC<\/li>  <li>S\u00ed<\/li>  <li>PC Sync.<\/li>  <li>Smart Switch (PC version)<\/li>  <li><b>Sistem