es<\/li><li><b>Procesador<\/b><\/li><li>MediaTek Helio G99<\/li><li>Hasta 2,2 GHz<\/li><li>Proceso de 6 nm<\/li><li><b>C\u00e1mara<\/b><\/li><li>C\u00e1mara trasera: 8 MP<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara frontal: 8 MP<\/li><li>Campo de visi\u00f3n de 105\u00b0 con FocusFrame<\/li><li><b>Altavoz<\/b><\/li><li>4 altavoces<\/li><li>Compatibles con Dolby Atmos\u00ae<\/li><li><b>Almacenamiento y RAM<\/b><\/li><li>3 GB+64 GB<\/li><li>RAM LPDDR4X y almacenamiento UFS 2.2<\/li><li>* El almacenamiento y la RAM disponibles son inferiores a la memoria total porque el dispositivo ya contiene el sistema operativo y el software preinstalados.<\/li><li><b>Bater\u00eda y carga<\/b><\/li><li>8000 mAh (typ)<\/li><li>Carga r\u00e1pida de 18 W<\/li><li><b>Conectividad<\/b><\/li><li>Bluetooth 5.3<\/li><li>Wi-Fi 5 de 2,4\/5 GHz<\/li><li>USB-C<\/li><li><b>Sistema operativo<\/b><\/li><li>MIUI para Pad<\/li><li><b>Contenido del paquete<\/b><\/li><li>Redmi Pad | Adaptador | Cable USB tipo C | Extractor de tarjeta SD | Gu\u00eda de inicio r\u00e1pido | Tarjeta de garant\u00eda<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"XIAOMI","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.57,"unit_price":182.7,"unit_price_tax":182.7,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Tablets","sub_category":"Tablets","quantity":5,"brand":"XIAOMI","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_xia-tab%20redmi%20pad%203-64%20gree_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":177.7}}},"6934177799013":{"result":false,"need_alert":false,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["6934177799013",false],"wholesale_price":[177.7,false],"price":[182.7,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["",false],"weight":["",false],"images":["",false],"t